{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1376c9bbb4dd2608956113a269e03ffdf9811b9de871f8e14ff071d6d6daff8d",
      "source_sha256": "b3b01e8d4df1a4e839742ce04f5195db481f9957adb954fa18d767f7b665ab55",
      "translation": "能和公主这样闲谈，实在令人愉快。不过，您最后说的那件事，总让我有些在意。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:42ad3100409c2d36cc746794dc838337e3782995c2dfca4458bb74b755556ab4",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:062634a7727128997dbeffef3c8e9a5a766912f1b9f7c9ccf0e2277ec373490a",
      "source_sha256": "e808a7088843bf73c4888b5df617eba63add6e06e0cd06cc513ce963bda01180",
      "translation": "失忆的话，来历也就无从查证。让这样的人加入南部军，真的妥当吗？我实在放心不下。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:474320b3ce03bc92cabbe80496ae1e197d793635c56a84b1a04a5605a923be38",
      "source_sha256": "49a70298e4be271075c413622f70be31fa05d02a979b3a4d1446de7c4b7b69ad",
      "translation": "朱特不是可疑的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9a480bf4d5e90945da4b602383d241deda14af32c7e7afe2375251f0ed7a4965",
      "source_sha256": "7bd0dfd85c7cdef38ab9b6d56f73a7814ef9b05749b80eef991860a88c36be8e",
      "translation": "他只是个因为朋友的死，而满怀愤怒的普通青年。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4d7a6a69fdd5233c627f19e6e49d3b9b3385573fcea1efd76ded3e110654d76e",
      "source_sha256": "d8c1e0376db0a8d7c81dbc339cdc93becc6fbf0e5dd83854895f33c7893e61a2",
      "translation": "而且，他对艾尔加的憎恨，已经让他打算不顾一切地去北方报仇。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:df0f5cb52b7217f370b060893d59a8f693f1ddf7c8017b64776198436628f284",
      "source_sha256": "944818e7d1cc2f266eb3e23d60c5f2220a8461fe4dca3b3f15146ee5508180bd",
      "translation": "不过，亲身经历真正的战争后，他就会明白自己的想法有多鲁莽。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2b0fc150f57a3f0e2783c043bf51bd22a53335a88d93618be3f1536fbfa3b151",
      "source_sha256": "677cb38aa560233a60e2a7ef0826a79b5048e67f81401518b4ba5c68b480997f",
      "translation": "所以我想，与其那样，不如让南部军收留他。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a0d9db24a23e3be9c44a87b13c5bedb0acd9228e1bcb5f435826e0f5a7359ed3",
      "source_sha256": "0a86ada3cd0109365b4f1af1b2c9bb1500ea3f7ffcb8fe82ef9cd15f2b887726",
      "translation": "我不希望朱特用极端的方式，白白葬送自己。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:88fc38e6e3dcd983a76366805b204ad6024dfc1db539f0d4a87cdf14baf85f6b",
      "source_sha256": "26ecf1ba59277ce33052b497a0e6b8a7c7449f5aea4089568ceb0c4974dd0825",
      "translation": "他会被复仇之心困住，我也有很大的责任。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:df040d85969719d0bee8fe253ca17bb193ad9d8b3a51f064b336755058791ed7",
      "source_sha256": "6546aa685b9cae9a03814252dcd1fffda08a7e798a3ace31ba147d1e871a7a96",
      "translation": "呵呵……公主如此关心他，连我都快嫉妒了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fc77826061ab47aab93ec2e599905d7f7cf3704e74e9a0764af3c75a37ba0a70",
      "source_sha256": "46194fd0cd716e0eddc901c9eb70c4a45ed9082fbac47c976eba06f5b29a6af9",
      "translation": "我现在不是在开玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e20b237c7280e92acd96db1667f7294d7e255189e61648d941cb746fab7655fb",
      "source_sha256": "cefa9674f97066dd88869f60fd678cfb0e1c6bc6389358d529f7b02af423254a",
      "translation": "虽然我不太赞同……但也不能拒绝公主的请求。真是没办法。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:de8aaf0f7d23ce0299b4476a94a1b7e352334be37f0ba96e8d70a4cfe365c31e",
      "source_sha256": "0331f1df9f324a640a7430269387ffbea4fbc3fa82f04c83cdf4aaf465b5afc8",
      "translation": "况且，如果他真的打倒了守护者，或许意外地能派上用场。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a9b6d5a64636beb3750a781d391981fbe13247df95e685786d66c6ae9f34579c",
      "source_sha256": "e1685dfcab339167b9af8e6bf23c39781a7b95a7490dfe4f638ee59eaf301509",
      "translation": "……谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ac551f9af00cafe3acfd0debb32cdc8618b254cdd00355c526a922a7630318a9",
      "source_sha256": "4d70a315bbf97abffa1a5065bbbb0b7cb0d4128df06d56dd64168151ddeb270d",
      "translation": "那么，我告辞了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b2cf9b573a3203113b145130ba4a625ae8a22ce410eeac2e9161b315f41a4ea9",
      "source_sha256": "5a0fa7a8642a33f2d3deacc2a4fde3712d6312ab804b3b28a377329876c127ae",
      "translation": "我倒不是非要索取什么回报……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:28e05cc6d1722c862e0bd57661869af3de6852d526c223c5c371dd9b0b259a1a",
      "source_sha256": "c5143e44f9150071635c5b279c10e3e785d39b9f0eb8b1c8c8ba001a28a73ac0",
      "translation": "难得答应了公主的请求，您若能多表现出一些谢意，我也会更高兴。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:04fe465c101a62333b5a7c3971f8710351cf8a2c9ac110e0a66fa43883042bd7",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a77f2884ebc5ece4c8639720061ce9d202612db1db6f12321b2e4453ef205411",
      "source_sha256": "06f04e5c5e395d3641c399108cdb8c3c2b8e33e26ba0141201ee9ba595d6c22a",
      "translation": "我已经很感谢你了，亚历克斯。如果还不够，要我跪下行礼吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:947ceeb40facd7f4efdfb2c2fac806627a7d9a74742ed373aaef8fcd05fb32df",
      "source_sha256": "566db41b4d44f3324f7adf58b34c4cc9f797e204b79299c862d3045b72cc406d",
      "translation": "哈哈哈……您又太敏感了。算了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5e04d71f410a241d5a2b7709e3c7342e8f2b002ca8e32491435e0a1789241e64",
      "source_sha256": "bbca81a77b8be9a2d06752cad4a615360f176ce4ab6427b9d2100d8ae5699761",
      "translation": "失陪了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7b8ba13b41bf6f9bc4ca9916eef6885589f6ec6264ca718af8a792a8944175e9",
      "source_sha256": "9768f2c531bf2663f183b5dcda6e167875aed6fdae4a8957203e0b99c9a163fd",
      "translation": "哼，真是高傲。反正不管怎样……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:afe8c7479ec74d73586a8001251c23a0dae51decd62dc5fab1f489e034631e72",
      "source_sha256": "6e98f61d0ccaddceb99037d3d7d8cddcdabf34a2d3dd8dff31e3fbfd69c077b6",
      "translation": "笑到最后的人，一定是我。这场战争，终究会以我的胜利结束。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:91ff82445a75fcd9fe9ec183ffec8e0fff8ac13af03507729ab77d81d8a05e4d",
      "source_sha256": "a9f72ddfc9d89f7455c7df7aec7e9d0dafd43ee05211d7e84ab1d5f6b6844cc6",
      "translation": "朱特？你怎么……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bd32d429d581a011d676b62ebc62daf331bccbc5e8e34d3e87e7c18c6a430ccc",
      "source_sha256": "f035c45d26b6c859f787f37601c1afd6d4aba4a469489989cb0e716e5d6054c3",
      "translation": "为了我，您竟然还得向亚历克斯低头……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:160b81146796eb1cd5ef12f6ff6336b733f94a24e6fe4443a8be0a7a7df70f42",
      "source_sha256": "8988162cb29d1972717f2dc2bb945b2f67e5c794bf2abe3e62682645bb012e4f",
      "translation": "与其这样，还不如我别加入军队……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fde848e074594a7bdd1cbfb8e13c02d4037a449cde10f68fb63aa6b9f3551e80",
      "source_sha256": "87c402ba6bae10e8b3f18e1c0ffd0be816751f79e331cc3376c09adb841f2b61",
      "translation": "你偷听到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:df887f2e9abd80eb5aeb467ce892413daa10db0aff2564935dd1ed385a75986e",
      "source_sha256": "bfeea2e185b792fbf0937aeea9bdc96a82222ba2f1d51f50387d8f648d0ae23d",
      "translation": "啊，我、我不是故意的……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b4b15f2388ff1ba19599dc28c99566429e36bbd6c1f12ac761418db570510e7e",
      "source_sha256": "8a19c99c8657596d1f6cc75bf8d98a5146fe70982fc9e55c4596d32f97159963",
      "translation": "只是……我不想让公主为了我，做到那种地步。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:93df2c8e16664a08b3002790cfb8797d6868101f2f16267cc674e5066f460743",
      "source_sha256": "f7ff5691ec62a8e56e51815580218825fbf91fda4d535ea3958fc984f1b321d3",
      "translation": "我是队长，关心部下是理所当然的，你不用放在心上。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:23b68be4d122f59e6be36ea16ff61d86c91cd9e70ea1495c34811da725241a1b",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9c2a0978441f8abef3952a2b98af33736fae78d93769f4a0d9ccadd81c08b282",
      "source_sha256": "9e8aed700c75ff9a6af3a4f578777c4157a87f80b41b2ba6d9648ad7c6e6f24c",
      "translation": "说起来，找我有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d8507ae6676497934e0de68fd96fccdce6b9f235f5fad3ea474590ba35a733d5",
      "source_sha256": "554bef4572fcc1815ceb4a453b786edc511b9c782f2d19a8c3a0797f5d477e22",
      "translation": "其实……我是来道歉的……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e46a52f551ab35b75730b856f787dfd4cca3978f8d8963a68ad6bc0aac1393d9",
      "source_sha256": "3ed94f7e18c7dd255fcef8ccb59f9564e6b35f04a4c8188263acdb41cd995537",
      "translation": "我不了解您的立场，却说了那么过分的话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ec67bc43b4b37de4eed9ada40aa26ad8955594b0413c04fbe22035acf5c8ef96",
      "source_sha256": "f5679e8ce001c10a5e509fbca845cfe3c159ddcea22ec897d2a4dc75c90d53af",
      "translation": "不用道歉，是我把你卷进了战争。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6aa479384edc31ff6f744312953ff88d192d80b9eaa0aba096356ede0f08957f",
      "source_sha256": "9fd27b696dd0a0f939685ad897dc0328d209d791220b6d69b5482c70916b5600",
      "translation": "加入南部军，是我自己的选择。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:66ecb6ede0f743a7298049c29eec824edf82a1f4a7e3a22f9bcb21270a2bc827",
      "source_sha256": "7949c146bcb14775a791258e4053063ad492534def506e9f7f587af1cd3d5f71",
      "translation": "可是，你也不想向亚历克斯低头，不是吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:866a83660df2f8a2c3f9c4441419fdb79ea61ad0426fddcf566cdad8aa11ccfc",
      "source_sha256": "8e98db5c0db41d6feb6696bec659282b693d68aaa92bba1879caf4c943fc0f92",
      "translation": "那是……！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cb2c66c2e489436e6eee4787f40f2efdde1316387d7ff4fd5eb8b0a75dc5d318",
      "source_sha256": "144c67f2ab5eea3ec914c27f1a442faa7f145e92581786169937ac92a39d24aa",
      "translation": "……对不起，就当我没说吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b0e95f09888e3808da8b51d63ba03c2b7e7f7249ee4add5f1558bae584f4fc86",
      "source_sha256": "30bfd2008fceb8d7dda39e09324a4cedcfc2739f08634b315a5645b172f4ec3e",
      "translation": "……？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2f429c040c62683b0eeabb15939ab15952e3143eff341417b7201ed8d34e746b",
      "source_sha256": "00f138ac2e0f8b22f75ae5d94e5670901232e4c93494beb860d910e762db0258",
      "translation": "现在想想，我也和其他人一样，在逼迫你。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:96f213d9b2fef9a3664c764b625e85e9893a97eb08d24fa33615e87b9408f14c",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:79aebb58030bf45e1c8e81538b1cd2585fdd2489239e1b523ce97ddf644176bb",
      "source_sha256": "a27db3ee35b92747bec2991662e92a8d467f4dfeb79faddfd999ff94da031495",
      "translation": "回去休息吧。过不了多久，恐怕又会有战斗了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4ff692f3d49c25bcafe2dcf564fb7593a5204685eb342c330476d7d8a6414857",
      "source_sha256": "4a34363ae0e4e970fba9916527a1d73299659545999b0098bb721d7442f938be",
      "translation": "我觉得自己必须说些什么，可最后，还是一句话也没说出来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:807622f638128ec57e6d1795803ed6f6bc616dac294b1f53b51c814665d211af",
      "source_sha256": "c6521ac16534d3900252a20271b94174e0b8941a5d8da4f96f5a15676dce46b8",
      "translation": "如今回想起来，“公主”这个称呼的重担，究竟把她压得有多沉重……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8f35d0bb2cdb7aae52a1557870e50ef908196e8ec7f9a99cef3613e05d9efa9b",
      "source_sha256": "104e29efe3db37c761519592cae349da87214cce4407b0d92090c74018f9b5f3",
      "translation": "怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1b4dbba3d63fd37407db3942beb4f379e5ecd7f8a8526f5db8b8a5ccf64d704d",
      "source_sha256": "793498354f7bfd026ba949fa3a9723766dd0738c8bacfeebaf1a7d0467f36f11",
      "translation": "嘿嘿嘿……很特别的案例，对卡蒙德居然没有排斥反应。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f2930393155f78c296c9793552d5f56ddd08ed18d8a762f311da2fe9ce154a4d",
      "source_sha256": "82d66d1a00ed68e70f726dcfe88c7d0cfd5e76185e42030f6aa3efc718ce77d7",
      "translation": "原来如此。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6e92ecfbc165f4e64f914e9d7a50b295c2c4a3dbf14b47ae456627c6f6925ad4",
      "source_sha256": "224045219d8422885e02f71d75a0c8fcf44bc65d2cc940fdfa711f42664db5c0",
      "translation": "不过，怎么突然想到这事？你需要一只听话的宠物吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:59da7568e5c6912c26a526b6cfbab1d553dea150e8f7911b6e5ce216e8ee412e",
      "source_sha256": "9725a03683e7b8b5b3b2900de4fdfe866011056a755dce0e161c17c84b4b3cc5",
      "translation": "这个嘛……就当是这样吧。不过，最好还能替我好好战斗。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3b38291fb4756391dd0aab04ef22a788ec629b07e02a27712ce276984c5586ff",
      "source_sha256": "286b588921cbfe55bb412129c81ae2c783ee4b78d807c6b893aee269cb0faef2",
      "translation": "用了这种程度的卡蒙德，能力肯定会比以前更强。嘿嘿嘿……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:18ea87376d80a0eab2319d62968678996fbe1603d257601e5d581673b61e60ca",
      "source_sha256": "7e42eacf926d03b2dc2a5bd68a74cac36efcd4b922fa8e115d76409da3647350",
      "translation": "那我就拭目以待了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fc476f3dc0bcf13a9f81e487eeb76d39315da99f78240d54d37b165237051f97",
      "source_sha256": "fba4fef21fd29a4da9baf6d0dd613560708d506b8c3f42e5c0ec54739c611c02",
      "translation": "劳德司令官下达了两项任务。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b5d303ecc137f0c330c8c3622499fdaab161fedca7f6a81ca6ddd9bdcbcfe765",
      "source_sha256": "6b1c53218f054df234ea0278ceb7a717d5f35f3a088b0e1bb7fbb8411237cde8",
      "translation": "才刚跟狼人打过一场，又有活干。南部军就只剩我们了吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0685d1fce8a83c3e70f140b076698e9d905523f99a3b6d0e536d6d73cbc58394",
      "source_sha256": "5369da6f7032a3a55c41d5e6cb8b7b4d7ab823de4061bb0fa7fc36205b269496",
      "translation": "而且，一来就是两项？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7c701a9953f8280eabf454fb1db22ff27320d523eaa61bf3602e8eaa79cb2d82",
      "source_sha256": "b4f5682c7ce14ea212d4a53f702071fd41e89541b699eb42d46fda9633089eec",
      "translation": "看来是要为老狐峡谷的战斗做准备，人手不足。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1073673c486e34a27709bb5d082118719d5433c0e1d7a1d9c9e5f26dbca99d1b",
      "source_sha256": "25acb93a9d6b055b01a46b11279e6051c6474ac70c280598eb6924281c5c1bbb",
      "translation": "首先，第一个任务，是消灭正在从阿巴泽特港口往城里移动的拉普斯变种。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ccc7ef7e865ead2d760eab792a12d97a04950486c37e1509f4fdbd067681151a",
      "source_sha256": "b94e8a99ee08b7cd0f2e463ed400eb924eb56ecff2b3c3dca6cd7a3728ec372f",
      "translation": "拉普斯，不就是风息岛海边那些家伙吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ab2442afa4ae3a321b18defc6a430970ce249c2e546d1e4e4464216f7251f7fe",
      "source_sha256": "9b0c1d80972d9a96d9f13bd0db7c1a191395bcf53128a309cfd10af6a4a8abd9",
      "translation": "没错。不过，这些变种只有彻底打碎外壳，才能打倒。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0776ace487e2ebf29fddd9d4844557d60fb310b94c126ff695402f2181045454",
      "source_sha256": "2d3d7178df27e6a824db74c484099a1b720e013dc456c0ad77eb8c567d9aa535",
      "translation": "而它们的外壳相当坚硬，似乎很难击碎。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:69a0c93fa536358edebbbb3d218d70bf3708d998d0c48e1ce8bb865ea3ddf167",
      "source_sha256": "b6f35e3da0887e3d4935dfb41785e4bef0692206a48c64de13766ee59dea5bfc",
      "translation": "难怪。就是因为麻烦，才把事情推给我们吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:71906416ac250108240a6cb091420f65f76327040bcb275a4b08cc928be3cc49",
      "source_sha256": "213261346f191da007181c593cdaae6acd7ed9057ef91211c13723615eaff321",
      "translation": "利用我所用斧子的固有技“破甲”，就能击碎它们的外壳。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1dbecb172e5b116165fd770a72d8d055ccf2236cb458023064bf5fd15c1c442c",
      "source_sha256": "1eba4d0bdfb3e6b5215d82617587c67876783f3a6eb5630fe718b2ff1235f775",
      "translation": "斧子已经由阿巴泽特入口的士兵准备好了，出发时去领取吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fdbedf5d17a9e5e447707e86f171c4422844048bb96333745bd6012471c155fd",
      "source_sha256": "5cfc3b9f28a2afb4270f290b60204046d340b60fed693e6ccc973f4164d1c0e8",
      "translation": "真是麻烦的任务。另一件是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:61ae1166433911ef45f9cf02eacdcff244c89cc9ca7f144d1c6ba51dc623fc6c",
      "source_sha256": "79431daa7b68c5b28dfc93bd3605497072c220f932352c178569b09b967f1439",
      "translation": "去阿巴泽特港口领取炸弹，似乎要用于老狐峡谷的战斗。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:12f544320053fc6d5fc63d433fa65ca26e139ec48d52ce081ba0c80d65760238",
      "source_sha256": "8177d91d3fbaabbafaca39ce089de9196a6666701869a4127f983d369647bfe0",
      "translation": "还真会变着花样使唤我们……真是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0a81698ab555c037b9c894ce1bb37b35b0ac3c0e625c37f8d611d6e4561b5064",
      "source_sha256": "c814cd953c14676af4d4bfb0addedd8408e5ef8800329b8d428808c08e96fdf5",
      "translation": "阿巴泽特港口附近，有一座协助我军的猫猫族村庄。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1628d8f4cef9686961fd184086ce1b11a05fa6f55fef8eb23842aa3fea9dbae0",
      "source_sha256": "480f26d05f880bb03ea3433b6626a044cb79069f66f11121fa4724a7d00dbcb0",
      "translation": "运到港口的军需品都由猫猫管理，所以炸弹也去那里领。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:56a9d3ab3d8078f2163e2d275838a24e248fe5f1a02ab83bd6a6795359bc7fb3",
      "source_sha256": "d4380c8b67569f68ba57eb8ebf89c1ce7a47c0a3d43abca8dfcc862e52d989e5",
      "translation": "说起来，之前就听说猫猫同族之间正在争夺领地，现在还是这样吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a24450e3caccadb5038612f9e225a4bb4095009a8d3dabd201811579133e92d1",
      "source_sha256": "e61d80e1657e422bde7e8ed1dc0c390c2d9c4b8c58f90e83c80ef82226212b0f",
      "translation": "那是积年累月的纠纷，哪能轻易解决。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5b1bac3417b7691b8b6b5dd1651b3aa6d76e04be0c4e620e267906e95ee475de",
      "source_sha256": "a260371da4c7c25dc87fb569e0a8c43418961afb2bb37cfdcaa27e0638ba0cc3",
      "translation": "那个女人看着没什么钱……哦！那位大叔看起来倒是挺有钱。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a286b90fe7227e836f05e25f4a5c28feb263dd96653780b304ff75659a46f5ee",
      "source_sha256": "822699e0bd49a67e16c85a41c4376f63d6ae9f3c12f61639b509508166c4d425",
      "translation": "看看那边，竟然在那种地方晾着衣服。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9669db62f9c82c6bf3fc51ee91c549d83267f6cdafe8289f1d98ffc898820ccb",
      "source_sha256": "d937903cee1f05cbb644b0f04bd19d3e10d4fe49c39d0157a44a95ed65408019",
      "translation": "我决定加入南部军了。等我赚够钱，就回来接你。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6cb084ed06a47e3846ddca997e109795be03f22d4fbdb3438ed99a544e27e969",
      "source_sha256": "033e8bb5ddef18935fab2b23a2dbef05f417b61e79cb62505fe7340e75537973",
      "translation": "不……别丢下我……要是你出了什么事，我还怎么活下去……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4081df095f1bfa9d993f8e77af231e3c7396177c3b0383b4c0411daef8b3d4ea",
      "source_sha256": "bf179edea1261befc5613863d7877ac69f68324c7e3b29ccfe5604736b1f95bb",
      "translation": "没事的，别担心。相信我，等我回来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fb07faf919e4531995ab4268c85ffdf1cb4493b13c1d6e3a62af7b9f9d9010d1",
      "source_sha256": "40d1167c378b776fbb88d007bb141e467f92ee6b8476f9e8e1a65ca0b343ee1e",
      "translation": "呜呜……你一定要平安回来……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c4fc1143a23702f3423a6bf41e0d49d032a081f5232cf7705fbbb814b9f44793",
      "source_sha256": "7d95ca73a1bf10bb9f4c71eb86dade55f115a309241a4c06ca015189cd3cede9",
      "translation": "听说这次又输给北部军了。继续相信南部军，留在阿巴泽特，真的没问题吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f017d82b0e85243d1373c1da52330f34c3a9f1e1bd2518c50547ab2bac633966",
      "source_sha256": "45e0f510a26d947902ac2a9662c66c0d766e5dc22b48253659fb643582f63d3b",
      "translation": "弑杀先王的修恩扎伊特，竟然还活得如此嚣张……这世道，到底怎么了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e36152bf5f018124cf697c3d8336cd66443d136e0e8619079fcc6c2e1d2f8885",
      "source_sha256": "b6a0ff3f50b7e03674276588ab18137b6c25bd155d603ce9ff4d814e5b3647d0",
      "translation": "看到这样的水，就不会想跳下去，痛痛快快游一场吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:80340e115d8718d9e7df9580511582543041f2a63be0798ce0c9c71e86603110",
      "source_sha256": "51498ca03e1050b48b41175f300b65a59df376b0154a7560a4c796e91fca1055",
      "translation": "战争的影响，比想象中还大。因为这场战争而受苦的阿维斯，也不在少数。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:00c6e56d5ee1920fdec972c4d618f8a37ccc09d1e720f9bc89d82cffb6add985",
      "source_sha256": "a1178022d528cc77fae1994589421180ae1fa5a17cfd148cf721eb6c0296812a",
      "translation": "我也想锻炼实力，然后加入南部军。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:66748b188cdb7a5473d8cf12ee12fb01c1bc9be610ebd9c5961972f77c155255",
      "source_sha256": "16c5f80794d78765882502277c629baae4c1eb6adcdb2dca0a2acfbf76a10c4b",
      "translation": "我想为赶走修恩扎伊特那个卑鄙的家伙，出一份力。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c6ae7356643011600af9ee7cdb5fcd48649e81b339417b47d7b9378edc3ab85b",
      "source_sha256": "d9d3204936dd0fc1d569b97a91d5d7406e9bf03c598151e51d86a3360d269345",
      "translation": "每天都活得提心吊胆，这样的日子，还要持续多久呢？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b678ca522b13e1d528bf45f4ffad51918aa5b6aee244be58b6caa57346379b04",
      "source_sha256": "c060e77b23491612d5ee44a8be354232e4407050be45151a4d417438f894da1d",
      "translation": "全都是你们的错！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0d16f6cbc83b153f550f7545dd67566c99e5008d8c02a80a5e1c6fa639dca920",
      "source_sha256": "15600c5358ea73cf799ada365d105ef6daabe7389abe5c65f8b838696b921f44",
      "translation": "就是因为你们无能，爸爸才会死，妈妈才会病倒！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ad93082516ce73005d498aac2b4570846b7312b55701c7f2b5fc3202a5564ef0",
      "source_sha256": "95d3fc3ace66bc6a7766aae315f2255d6cfdea17097e952f992cf0814366d3d6",
      "translation": "你听说过柯塔马雷吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0721383c2cbc3e9e30b828ad826c479009316b2d36468831a1bb6dc6ebd39d47",
      "source_sha256": "68d0194062af92552eab8dd7a220e216db5c4fbf48148f311c15f0c70dae788f",
      "translation": "听说马雷族全都是俊男美女，是真的吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e8261685a28438f9301ebc2c8ff51f165d861d06396b1470df427ae9c5f872f4",
      "source_sha256": "7412d1b455bf07dba38d5819d36e1d22052d003decdd3ee687f7a7b56cfad6e3",
      "translation": "战争要是能早点结束就好了……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fcf6b4880ddab16358ae725182f42e354152b1e52d4c379d9e450d89e5078c52",
      "source_sha256": "695ef10300b21ffe6ad0265b31e1de7262618b2f1ff8e8e687a65ef93aeb76b7",
      "translation": "你听过这种说法吗？世上至少有三个和自己长得一模一样的人。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:561775e91eeed0a55a6d7af062e16bfdd9b7e75a50d8ffd115552284b9c845c5",
      "source_sha256": "e69cdc1217f9649ce67bc05f0ce86fa407b28f1b15a03f3caf08df9acec2e635",
      "translation": "这里也可能藏着北部军的探子，请时刻保持警惕。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4e1013a66ebd94a3abe2fb541cf62c30fcf98bb66fcaccf78bffd7f36b2ce0d4",
      "source_sha256": "e4ef45cc70ac6694fe56eae3fcb8b24e0dfc9b51cbd3b5caa4518beb5814dd7f",
      "translation": "对狩猎怪物感兴趣吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:119e736e9d05990e4dedf8b38119895abc835662ac311827c7517bf72c9ea4c4",
      "source_sha256": "0b84cebe28e34f86b10aff4fef2029a304b7b7aadb00bec3fbdda8504c473391",
      "translation": "狩猎的基本，就是找准敌人的弱点，一举击倒。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:86f10d1c99342e4c84419dbba12ac6559072c992f36599b03e865f89cb27cb7d",
      "source_sha256": "efcc4a67b5e54fb666f8c96531ee041d31b01013058f13a4657ee290119614c3",
      "translation": "先拿[蓬蓬]练练，掌握狩猎的诀窍吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ffb18206a78e3d4ce550caf7b252c5e5d76e21c46d4f74c2b46b2412059f606a",
      "source_sha256": "bb4c23d50f4d42ddc5a1a7e6967094d3d87a8f382785f308d651ff9d2e5519d6",
      "translation": "蓬蓬会用树叶遮住本体，很难准确地攻击到它。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8a45eff083762ebe22731ae1f8e6f14e8ad1613d6deb88e52c239e632d9b2e83",
      "source_sha256": "093a4ce966285fa86be0b7ab4ce06c573871c7e1cb7ff38c23faff7334c1403f",
      "translation": "不过，用风属性连环术使它陷入[晕眩]，就能攻击本体了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a4dc619ba17638a92cc0e4cb264b60dd854e61beea94dad5190c23afa99f31b2",
      "source_sha256": "5ffd3108467545aadc35ed9d0f34c7d7d4acb36325f3bb061e817b39d3cbea2d",
      "translation": "趁那个时候，合力发动攻击。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0f799988fcf1889e5f5f50a49c8489bdcb75b230e670d5682c9f848585eb2c16",
      "source_sha256": "3e07f3d7dcc90855efa1d22fd3340e4689cf34e28377720b562bb677556b62a9",
      "translation": "明白诀窍后，就去阿巴泽特野外对付蓬蓬吧。至少也得猎杀3只，对不对？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:384df46e7a588797961322a61088768d137e4c10ab2993610102ef92d42c1e3e",
      "source_sha256": "8f7fe87c71b792db04a7e0b3cfc3b7e8858d69aca5043d39531919f4c0c6b26a",
      "translation": "先造成[晕眩]，再合力攻击。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
